{"id":"sculk-monstrosity","slug":"sculk-monstrosity","name":"幽匿巨兽","english":"Sculk Monstrosity","kind":"enemy","categoryKey":"enemies","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/database/renders-thumb-sculk-monstrosity.png","description":"","parameters":[["基础生命","2,000"],["基础伤害","35"],["韧性","1,200"],["灵魂","200"],["弱点","火焰 ×1.5"],["最高单次伤害","35"],["速度","300"]],"tables":[{"title":"Where you fight it","columns":["WHEN","QUEST","WHERE"],"rows":[["Story quest","草甸巨兽","吟唱者草甸"],["支线任务","灾厄村民情报","冰封高地"],["Dungeon boss room","End of the procedural dungeon","汐浮裂隙"],["Rematch","复活的幽匿巨兽","吟唱者草甸"],["灵魂风暴、possible","20 minute storms every 40 minutes","咆哮树林、吟唱者草甸、多雨平原、轰鸣虫壳地、安眠丘陵、冰封高地、蜜脾原野"]]},{"title":"Moves","columns":["移动","效果","基础伤害","类型"],"rows":[["Punch combo","Two punches into a narrow cone in front of it、each with a short lunge. Sidestepping beats backing off、because it follows up with Swipe、which reaches farther.","12.5",""],["Swipe","A single arm sweep covering twice the angle of the punches、with longer reach、harder knockback. It follows a finished punch combo、so keep a dodge ready for it.","20",""],["Charge","Once you're a few steps away it winds up、then rushes you far faster than it walks、launches whatever it hits、its own cubes included. It can only turn 20 degrees per 秒ond mid-charge、so sidestep late、it runs past.","25",""],["Mega punch","Right after a charge it plants itself、winds up a glowing right fist、lunges into a soul punch that inflicts Soulsick. It's the hardest hit it has but covers only a narrow cone、so get to its side during the long wind-up、and expect the punch combo next if you're still close.","35","灵魂"],["Sculk projectile","When you're well out of reach it fires three sculk blobs from its back in quick succession、each arcing down toward you. Every blob bursts where it lands、starts a sculk ripple、so get off the spot you were standing on.","20",""],["Sculk ripple","Each projectile impact sends a ring spreading slowly outward along the ground. You can jump over it or roll through it、and it only hits you once.","15",""],["Cube summon","It stops、roars、and 5 to 7 Sculk Cubes appear around the arena shortly after、up to 15 at a time. At 15 health each they die fast、and they share the boss's fire weakness.","",""],["Catalyst summon","Once it's at 70% health or lower、its hands glow、2 or 3 sculk catalysts rise at set spots in the arena. Any catalyst still standing when its 12-second timer runs out bursts、heals the boss、and with 22 health each they're cheap to destroy.","",""]]},{"title":"变种","columns":["形态","基础生命","基础伤害","韧性","灵魂"],"rows":[["基础形态","2,000","35","1,200","200"],["灵魂风暴","700","20","700","200"]]},{"title":"弱点与抗性","columns":["属性","变化"],"rows":[["火焰伤害","+50%"],["灵魂伤害","-35%"]]},{"title":"原生属性（定义值）","native":true,"note":"解包表中的直接定义值；继承、难度与战力缩放另行计算。","columns":["定义","参数","数值"],"rows":[["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","生命","2000"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","灵魂伤害抗性倍率","0.65"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","火焰伤害抗性倍率","1.5"],["幽匿巨兽 · StormiSculk","生命","700"],["幽匿巨兽 · StormiSculk","灵魂伤害抗性倍率","0.65"],["幽匿巨兽 · StormiSculk","火焰伤害抗性倍率","1.5"]]},{"title":"原生能力参数","native":true,"note":"保留能力的定义值与覆盖操作；未翻译的内部字段保留原名。","columns":["定义","能力","参数","数值","操作"],"rows":[["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","Punch","最大目标距离","600","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","Punch","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","Punch","触发权重","100","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","Punch","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","Punch","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","挥击","最大目标距离","1000","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","挥击","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","挥击","触发权重","100","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","挥击","冷却时间","0","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","挥击","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","红石投射物","最大目标距离","0","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","红石投射物","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","红石投射物","触发权重","100","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","红石投射物","冷却时间","10","定义值"],["幽匿巨兽 · MonstrositySculk","红石投射物",